keletonPlaceholder__Placeholder-sc-189f01ff-0 fJHdTV"></div><!--/$--><!--$--><h1 class="sc-dntSTA faqdLc sc-kvnevz doYsMw" data-test="pageHeaderHeading">Nieuwe aansluiting aanvragen </h1><!--/$--><p class="sc-dntSTA kywxq text-l" data-test="pageHeaderText">Is uw woning nog niet aangesloten op het energienet? Dan kunt u geen stroom of gas gebruiken. Wij sluiten uw woning aan op het energienet.  </p><div class="sc-bRKDuR dPZLpT PageHeader__LeftColumnPlaceholderContainer-sc-e61b7c58-0 gEVfjH"><div class="sc-bRKDuR iTbFOD"><section data-test="alertSection"><div role="alert" class="sc-eQwNpu jcnCoj sc-eVqvcJ ioSAcC"><svg class="sc-hvigdm jZJZph sc-gvqKNf bjaVdg" data-test="icon-infoCircle" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 8a8 8 0 1 1 16 0A8 8 0 1 1 0 8"></path><path fill="#fff" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M9 7v5H7V7zM8 4a1 1 0 1 0 0 2 1 1 0 0 0 0-2" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg><div class="sc-cOpnSz OhfJp"><h4 class="sc-dntSTA jXLyks sc-kvnevz doYsMw Alert__AlertHeading-sc-6fafe4d4-0 kWWPiq" data-test="alertHeading">Let op</h4><p class="sc-dntSTA JQfdQ">Wilt u een nieuwe of zwaardere elektriciteitsaansluiting? Check eerst of het nog past op het stroomnet.</p><a title="" target="" class="sc-jkvfRO fQRwuT Alert__AlertLink-sc-6fafe4d4-1 hjheKF" data-test="alertLink" href="/aansluitingen/check-het-stroomnet"><svg data-test="icon-arrowRight" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" class="sc-hvigdm jZJZph"><path fill="currentColor" d="M8 0 6.59 1.41 12.17 7H0v2h12.17l-5.58 5.59L8 16l8-8z"></path></svg><span class="sc-dTvVRJ jvNhrk">Check het stroomnet in uw buurt</span></a></div></div></section></div></div></div><div data-test="rightColumn" class="sc-bbbBoY biPPc"><figure class="Image__ImageFigure-sc-499a0770-1 ljtLmI PageHeaderImage__RightImage-sc-5e1e9528-0 gxrfby" data-test="pageHeaderImage"><img alt="" width="1121" height="1121" loading="eager" sizes="(max-width: 740px) calc(100vw - 32px), (max-width: 980px) calc(